{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a repeating street.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your surroundings carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253620/extras/f7bd09579e6a896897956c93dfd09fe2.poster.avif?t=1769674972\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253620/extras/f7bd09579e6a896897956c93dfd09fe2.webm?t=1769674972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253620/extras/f7bd09579e6a896897956c93dfd09fe2.mp4?t=1769674972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Look for anything that feels wrong.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you notice an anomaly, choose correctly.<br>If nothing is wrong, move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every detail matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253620/extras/10aca3cd535253a71b15554add42afbf.poster.avif?t=1769674972\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253620/extras/10aca3cd535253a71b15554add42afbf.webm?t=1769674972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253620/extras/10aca3cd535253a71b15554add42afbf.mp4?t=1769674972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Exit Project: Backstreets</strong> is a <strong>first-person psychological horror walking experience</strong> where you are trapped in an <strong>endlessly repeating urban street</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>short, atmospheric horror experience</strong> is inspired by <strong>liminal spaces</strong>, urban backstreets, and the fear of subtle inconsistencies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment changes subtly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missing objects. Unsettling sounds. Strange events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you must make <strong>10 correct choices in a row</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253620/extras/43cfaf53126656c4c089bbf8f2cd07a0.poster.avif?t=1769674972\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253620/extras/43cfaf53126656c4c089bbf8f2cd07a0.webm?t=1769674972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253620/extras/43cfaf53126656c4c089bbf8f2cd07a0.mp4?t=1769674972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime:</strong> 20\u201360 minutes<br><strong>Features:</strong><br>\u2013 Immersive first-person perspective<br>\u2013 Psychological &amp; atmospheric horror<br>\u2013 Memory-based anomaly detection<br>\u2013 Singleplayer\u00a0<br>\u2013 Full controller support<br>\u2013 Customizable graphics and camera settings</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Finally Arrived","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3253620/ba31fc76e0a37f4f181d8770b21b8b146fc8c693.jpg"},{"name":"Reach Street 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3253620/37f121bb8548e6787ea78901bc46f88cf50f378b.jpg"},{"name":"Reach Street 9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3253620/b5c510e802506ae0c2603cd93a470f22ff6e2c4d.jpg"},{"name":"Reach Street 8","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommun